reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Lemma 4.2, p. 89; scan 97"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 是有限词中的字符集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\nA_0^G\\coloneqq\\{S\\},\\qquad A_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq A_n^G\\cup\\{B\\in V:\\exists A\\in A_n^G\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;((A,\\alpha)\\in P\\land B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\nA_0^G\\coloneqq\\{S\\},\\qquad A_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq A_n^G\\cup\\{B\\in V:\\exists A\\in A_n^G\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;((A,\\alpha)\\in P\\land B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A_n^G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A_n^G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可达性只要求出现在某个可导出的句型中，不保证能最终导出终结词；与生成性必须区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-cfg-structure]]，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha)$ 是有限词中的字符集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\nA_0^G\\coloneqq\\{S\\},\\qquad A_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq A_n^G\\cup\\{B\\in V:\\exists A\\in A_n^G\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;((A,\\alpha)\\in P\\land B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\alpha))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A_n^G","display":true}],"bytes":1587,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables|从开始符号可达的非终结符]]"},{"id":"986d1f0d42f55125","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)$，并满足 $\\operatorname{Generating}(G)=\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G)=V$。相应定义见 [[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]、[[73-df-cfg-generating-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]；闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"a01cd76e5cbb0051","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$A\\in V$。三个阶段序列和推导语言见 [[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-generating-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。"},{"id":"0b91495e20376554","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 且 $L(G)\\ne\\varnothing$。生成性与可达性见 [[73-df-cfg-generating-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables]]；语义见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]、[[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]。"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}